{"id":"n25373-1-9","stage":3,"title":"체험 · 体验","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25373-1-9-1","ko":"이번 해외여행에서 많이 배우고 왔어?","zh":"这次出国旅行你学到了很多吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"해외여행에서","meaning":"海外旅行，境外游","explanation":"해외여행：海外旅行，境外游；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72474","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해외여행에서","audio":"/audio/7c328a98d61e47ac4b44.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"배우고","meaning":"学会，领悟","explanation":"배우다：学会，领悟；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"3","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배우고","audio":"/audio/4d98a3f91ae7d111ca0a.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciati